.SH NAME
QLineEdit \- Simple line editor for inputting text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qlineedit.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QWidget.
.PP
Inherited by QRenameEdit.
.PP
